message: "If you use Noone Protocol, its Verifiable Agent Passport, or the Framing & Principal Invariance Benchmark (Decision Flip Rate), please cite this repository."
title: "Noone Protocol: Deterministic Framing & Principal Invariance Benchmark and Verifiable Agent Alignment Standard"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Noone Protocol Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/noone-protocol/noone-protocol"
url: "https://noone-protocol.github.io/noone-protocol/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.2.0-beta"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
keywords:
  - ai-alignment
  - agentic-ai
  - framing-invariance
