  - verifiable-credentials
  - ai-safety-benchmark
abstract: >-
  An open-standard behavioral alignment framework and deterministic Framing &
  Principal Invariance benchmark for autonomous AI agents. Measures Decision
  Flip Rate across controlled minimal-pair shifts in requester principal
  (Human vs. A2A Orchestrator Agent), grammatical subject (2nd vs. 3rd person),
  verb modality (deontic Should vs. alethic Can vs. imperative), and tone
  (neutral vs. harsh urgency vs. polite framing) without relying on a
  same-family LLM judge.
